[h1]XenoAmess的体验优化[/h1]
[h2]XenoAmess Quality of Life[/h2]

[b]把重复而确定的操作交给决议：自动防御召援、批量改信、牵制索款、赎囚与附条件释放，同时保留一期的行政继任和禁转封优化。[/b]
[b]Turn repetitive, deterministic chores into decisions: defensive calls, realm conversions, hook payments, ransoms and conditional releases, alongside the original appointment and vassal-transfer improvements.[/b]

1.1.3 · CK3 1.21.0.3 Florin compatibility maintenance
1.1.3 · CK3 1.21.0.3 Florin 兼容维护

[img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/XenoAmess/ck3_eternal_recurrence/3ecba400af0b4c985059459eb3215d169c6b3a53/mod_xenoamess_quality_of_life/thumbnail.png[/img]

[h1]1.21 Florin 兼容维护 / 1.21 Florin Compatibility Maintenance[/h1]

相对上一公开版1.1.0，更新新版行政、贤能及天朝任命覆盖，保留原版候选资格、计分、等级与冷却，以及原五处玩家百万分扣分。转封保护采用行政机制门禁；修正免费防御召集的朝贡合同方向，并适配改信、礼仪和条件释放的原版上下文与条件。
Relative to public1.1.0, appointment projections follow current Administrative, Meritocratic and Celestial vanilla sources, retaining eligibility, scoring, tiers, cooldowns and the original five player score penalties. Transfer protection uses the administrative mechanic; defensive calls correct the tributary-contract direction; conversion, rite and conditional-release contexts follow current vanilla rules.

适配新版黄金义务完整报价与当前钱包付款的拆分，保留强牵制报价与原版互动支付；普通足额赎金使用新版普通赎金值。简中家族关系变化数值仅补齐富文本分隔空格，金额表达式不变。三独立开关、生产业务ID、滑条和九语言功能文案保留；运行清单由24增至28文件。
Golden Obligation now distinguishes the full quote from the current-wallet payment, retaining strong-hook pricing and vanilla interaction payment. Full ordinary ransom checks use the current normal-ransom value. A single separator space fixes the Simplified Chinese house-relation amount formatting without changing its amount expression. The three toggles, production IDs, slider and nine language texts remain; the runtime inventory grows from24 to28 files.

[h1]三个独立开关 / Three Independent Toggles[/h1]

[list]
[*][b]自动选择继任 / Automatic Appointments[/b]：开启后，行政制、贤能制与天朝制玩家本人不再成为下属行政官职的兜底候选。候选池、资格和继承分数仍全部使用原版；死亡或卸任时由最高分的其他合资格候选人接任。
[*][b]别把封臣给我 / Do Not Give Me Vassals[/b]：开启后，下属行政统治者不会再通过原版 AI“授予封臣”逻辑把自己的法理封臣向上转给玩家。玩家主动转封不受影响。
[*][b]自动召集防御援军 / Automatic Defensive Calls[/b]：被宣战后，自动召集当下可以免费加入的 AI 盟友、保证援助玩家的宗主、负有强制参战义务的朝贡者、可参战摄政和免费家系成员。不会花费金钱、威信或虔诚；需要付费的宗族/朝贡召集不执行。
[/list]

三个功能默认关闭，可在决议面板的【XenoAmess的体验优化】分组中分别开启或关闭。关闭后恢复手动或原版行为。
All three features are off by default and can be toggled independently from the “XenoAmess Quality of Life” Decisions group. Disabling one restores manual or vanilla behavior.

[h1]二期批处理决议 / Phase-Two Bulk Decisions[/h1]

[list]
[*][b]批量要求改信 / Bulk Conversion Demands[/b]：使用 0–100 滑动条设定最低原版接受值。只向领内达到门槛且可合法要求改信的 AI 发出请求；全部答复后用气泡汇总同意与拒绝人数。
[*][b]批量牵制索款 / Bulk Hook Payments[/b]：足额模式只处理能付清者；现有款模式处理金钱大于 1 的目标并收取其当前全部整数金钱。两种模式都复用原版互动并消耗牵制。
[*][b]批量赎囚 / Bulk Ransoms[/b]：足额模式只接受完整赎金；现有款模式只要愿意付款的 AI 至少有 1 金钱，就收取其当前钱财并放人。
[*][b]批量附条件释放 / Bulk Conditional Release[/b]：为每名愿意的囚犯选择“获得牵制、招募、要求改信”中数量最多的兼容组合；同规模时依次优先牵制、招募、改信。
[/list]

这些批处理决议只处理通过对应原版互动条件的 AI 目标；没有合资格目标时结果为 0，不会绕过战争、宗教、囚禁、冷却或关系限制。
These decisions only process AI targets that pass the matching vanilla interaction rules. With no eligible target, the result is zero; war, faith, imprisonment, cooldown and relationship restrictions are not bypassed.

[h1]适用范围 / Scope[/h1]

[list]
[*]自动继任与禁止转封：仅限非 AI、独立的行政制、贤能制或天朝制玩家
[*]自动防御召援与二期批处理：所有非 AI 统治者；具体目标仍须通过原版条件
[*]Appointments and transfer guard: human independent Administrative, Meritocratic or Celestial rulers
[*]Defensive calls and phase-two bulk actions: all human rulers; every target must still pass vanilla conditions
[/list]

[h1]兼容性 / Compatibility[/h1]

面向 CK3 1.21.0.3 / Florin。本机已有限验证宋帝三个独立开关的启停、开启状态的存档值，以及改宗门槛取消、提交100后重开100、恢复50后重开50。本机另在同一场完成改宗门槛保存100、恢复50、重新打开读回及窗口关闭后干净地图的四步检查。旧核心、付款、继任与防御实证保留各自原版本范围；未宣称当前完整UI25项、官职任命或全功能矩阵。简中负数家族关系提示的本次源修正未新验当前负值对象渲染。推荐单人存档；没有新增必须执行的存档迁移程序，更新前保留备份。
For CK3 1.21.0.3 / Florin. Bounded current-version checks cover the Song ruler’s three independent toggles and their saved enabled values, plus threshold cancellation, commit100/reopen100 and restore50/reopen50. A separate same-session four-step check also completed commit100, restore50, fresh reopen readbacks and a clean map after window closure. Historical core, payment, succession and defense evidence keeps its original engine scope; current full25 UI, appointments and whole-feature matrices are not claimed. The Simplified Chinese separator source repair has no new current-version negative-object render check. Single-player is recommended. No mandatory save migration is added; back up before updating.

自动继任功能会按相同相对路径覆盖原版的三份 appointment 文件，因此与改写下列文件的其他 mod 不兼容：
Automatic appointments replace these three vanilla files at the same relative paths and are therefore incompatible with other mods that replace them:

[list]
[*]`common/succession_appointment/admin_governor.txt`
[*]`common/succession_appointment/meritocratic_governor.txt`
[*]`common/succession_appointment/celestial_governor.txt`
[/list]

[h1]本地化 / Localization[/h1]

简体中文与 English 为审阅基准；Français、Deutsch、日本語、한국어、Polski、Русский、Español 已补齐翻译并通过结构、格式与术语审计，不声称获得七语母语级签核。
Simplified Chinese and English are the reviewed baselines. French, German, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Russian and Spanish are translated and structurally audited; native-speaker approval for those seven languages is not claimed.

